  "description": "Removal of Condition 2 for planning application ref: 08/AP/1476 dated 21/10/2009 for 'Change of use of the existing B2 Business Use/Light Industrial, 3-storey premises, to a mixed use B1 - Business, D1- Non-residential institution, D2 - Assembly building for Small to Medium Enterprise (SME) business start-up building, by retaining part of the building as offices for SME business start-up units; and establishing a performing arts centre incorporating dance studios, recording studios, recital hall and auditorium with back stage facilities, training and resource rooms; and use as a place of worship.'\rRemoval Condition 2 restricts the approved D1 Non-residential institution and D2 Assembly building uses to \"Liberty Development Enterprise\" as a personal restriction. This condition has become obsolete as Liberty Development Enterprise has vacated the premises and relocated their operations elsewhere. The building is operated by a church organisation providing the same community facilities originally envisaged - place of worship, community activities, and associated services.",
